#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_House/scripts.inc:12
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_House_Text_TrainersGatherAtPokemonLeague"
msgid ""
"Far away, deep in EVER GRANDE CITY,\n"
"is the POKéMON LEAGUE.\p"
"The TRAINERS who gather there are\n"
"all frighteningly well skilled.$"
msgstr ""
"在遥远的彩幽市的深处，\n"
"有宝可梦联盟。\p"
"聚集在那里的训练家\n"
"个个都厉害得吓人。$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_House/scripts.inc:18
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_House_Text_DefeatEliteFourInARow"
msgid ""
"In the POKéMON LEAGUE, I think the\n"
"rules say that you have to battle the\l"
"ELITE FOUR all in a row.\p"
"If you lose to any of them, you have\n"
"to begin your challenge again from the\l"
"first one.$"
msgstr ""
"我记得宝可梦联盟的规则\n"
"是必须连续挑战四天王。\p"
"只要输给其中任何一个人，\n"
"就得从第一个人\l"
"重新开始挑战。$"
